# Bungalow – Linux Dev Toolkit 🐧

**Author:** Eid Ali <eid.horus@gmail.com>  
**Inspired by:** Classic Linux tools and the love for a clean terminal workflow  

---

## Description

Bungalow is a **terminal-based GUI** that lets Linux users quickly install programming tools, compilers, interpreters, IDEs, web development stacks, debuggers, game engines, and graphics tools.  

- Already installed tools are automatically detected and checked.  
- Option to “Install everything” in a section.  
- Works with multiple distributions (Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, Arch, OpenSUSE, etc.) by automatically detecting your package manager.  
- Clean, simple, and friendly for both new users and seasoned Linux developers.  

> *May the Penguin be with you! 🐧*

